<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies five bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies five bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Monday it qualified five bond issues for insurance slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Addison, Ill., $4.6 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Caledonia, Wis., $7.4 milion GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Marshall, Minn., $2.3 million of tax increment bonds, $1.1 million of tax increment bonds and $4.9 million of tax increment bonds.</p>
<p>--Avon Grove SD, Pa., $6.1 million and $9.9 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Franklin Regional School District, Pa., $4.9 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
